00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:33,570 --> 00:01:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...!</font>

32
00:01:34,990 --> 00:01:37,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He came in totally late.</font>

33
00:01:41,910 --> 00:01:44,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm? Where's Sasuke?</font>

34
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:47,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Dosu guy I'm supposed
to fight isn't here, either.</font>

35
00:01:47,790 --> 00:01:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you guys over there.</font>

36
00:01:49,830 --> 00:01:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Throw out your chests and
show your faces to the spectators!</font>

37
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are the stars
of this "final round"!</font>

38
00:02:19,950 --> 00:02:22,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke hasn't been found yet?</font>

39
00:02:23,530 --> 00:02:26,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A team of several ANBU members
are searching all over,</font>

40
00:02:26,580 --> 00:02:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but they have found nothing.</font>

41
00:02:29,420 --> 00:02:32,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He might already be in
the hands of Orochimaru...</font>

42
00:02:33,380 --> 00:02:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case,
we may never find him.</font>

43
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand.</font>

44
00:02:45,010 --> 00:02:48,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well well... Kazekage-dono.</font>

45
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:07,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must be tired having
come all this way.</font>

46
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:11,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I'm glad the arena
is in the Leaf Village.</font>

47
00:03:12,330 --> 00:03:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though you're still young, it would
probably be a tough journey for you</font>

48
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:19,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you had to go to the trouble
of traveling someplace else.</font>

49
00:03:21,050 --> 00:03:24,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shouldn't you decide on
the Fifth Hokage soon?</font>

50
00:03:29,980 --> 00:03:33,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't treat me
like an old person.</font>

51
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm still planning on
being Hokage for another five years...</font>

52
00:03:44,990 --> 00:03:49,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, I guess it's
about time to begin.</font>

53
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:59,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone, thank you very much
for coming</font>

54
00:04:00,010 --> 00:04:04,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the Village Hidden in Leaves
Chunin Exam.</font>

55
00:04:05,340 --> 00:04:08,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will now begin the
"final round" matches</font>

56
00:04:08,850 --> 00:04:12,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the eight who made it
through the preliminaries!</font>

57
00:04:12,890 --> 00:04:16,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please watch until the end!</font>

58
