72
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:52,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, I had more preliminary
matches than the others...</font>

73
00:04:54,060 --> 00:04:56,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the Dosu guy dropped out?</font>

74
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:05,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I'd pound you here...</font>

75
00:05:05,860 --> 00:05:09,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I did that,
there'd be the possibility for me,</font>

76
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:13,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as the one remaining after
the first battle, to fight Sasuke-kun.</font>

77
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:19,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What are you?!</font>

78
00:05:26,430 --> 00:05:27,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say...</font>

79
00:05:27,890 --> 00:05:28,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...say.</font>

80
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:30,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

81
00:05:30,470 --> 00:05:33,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm... Sasuke still hasn't come.</font>

82
00:05:34,060 --> 00:05:35,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What'll happen?</font>

83
00:05:39,810 --> 00:05:43,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Sasuke-kun really did sneak out
of the hospital room at that time.</font>

84
00:05:48,910 --> 00:05:51,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something could've happened to him...</font>

85
00:05:52,540 --> 00:05:56,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In case a competitor does not arrive
by the start time of his match...</font>

86
00:05:58,710 --> 00:06:00,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he or she will lose by default!</font>

87
00:06:03,250 --> 00:06:04,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't make sense.</font>

88
00:06:05,130 --> 00:06:09,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knowing his character,
he'd come even if he had to drag himself.</font>

89
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you going, Gaara?</font>

90
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:24,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To verify my existence...
one more time.</font>

91
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:44,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more time.</font>

92
00:06:44,380 --> 00:06:47,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong?
You should still be able to move, right?!</font>

93
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:53,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! Come on!</font>

94
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:06,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be...?</font>

95
00:07:06,730 --> 00:07:09,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even after I warned him to avoid
doing anything to stand out...</font>

96
00:07:10,110 --> 00:07:14,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He didn't kill that Uchiha Sasuke
also, did he...?</font>

97
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:19,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up, you guys.</font>

98
00:07:19,910 --> 00:07:23,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The terrain is different,
but the rule is that there are no rules,</font>

99
00:07:23,330 --> 00:07:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the same as
in the preliminaries.</font>

100
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:30,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The matches will continue until one
or the other dies, or acknowledges defeat.</font>

101
00:07:33,050 --> 00:07:38,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, if I judge that it has been settled,
I'll stop the match there.</font>

102
00:07:38,850 --> 00:07:40,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arguments will not be allowed.</font>

103
00:07:41,350 --> 00:07:42,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood?</font>

104
00:07:45,270 --> 00:07:47,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the first match is...</font>

105
00:07:48,230 --> 00:07:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto.</font>

106
00:07:52,410 --> 00:07:53,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hyuga Neji.</font>

107
00:07:54,490 --> 00:07:58,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just those two remain and
the rest of you go to the waiting room.</font>

108
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:10,550
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Byaku-
gan</font>

109
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:10,550
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">VS</font>

110
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:10,550
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Shadow
Clones!</font>

111
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:10,550
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="50">I will definitely win!!</font></font>

112
00:08:16,850 --> 00:08:19,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Hinata! These seats are open.</font>

113
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:23,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-huh.</font>

114
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:27,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This match will be quite interesting!</font>

115
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:31,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

116
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, Sakura.</font>

117
00:08:35,740 --> 00:08:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand that you're worried
about Sasuke-kun.</font>

118
00:08:38,830 --> 00:08:41,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why don't you cheer
for Naruto at least a little bit?</font>

119
00:08:43,250 --> 00:08:46,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm. You're right.</font>

120
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That being said,</font>

121
00:08:48,170 --> 00:08:51,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with Neji as his opponent,
Naruto has no chance of winning.</font>

122
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is...!</font>

123
00:08:53,010 --> 00:08:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not so, is what you're
going to say?</font>

124
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:02,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But to think that brat would
survive until this point...</font>

125
00:09:03,890 --> 00:09:06,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if this is
as far as it goes</font>

126
00:09:06,150 --> 00:09:08,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for those who survived
just by luck, after all.</font>

127
00:09:08,110 --> 00:09:09,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto.</font>

128
00:09:11,150 --> 00:09:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is not a good opponent at all.</font>

129
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:16,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how you look at it,
he can't beat the Hyuga clan.</font>

130
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:23,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's what I thought
at the beginning...</font>

131
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:28,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you'll all be surprised
if you underestimate him.</font>

132
00:09:30,210 --> 00:09:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru, what's wrong?</font>

133
00:09:34,220 --> 00:09:35,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

134
00:09:38,970 --> 00:09:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Where?!</font>

135
00:09:45,060 --> 00:09:46,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

136
00:09:49,770 --> 00:09:51,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's ANBU, the Black Ops,
doing here?</font>

137
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:54,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is something going on...?</font>

138
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:06,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You seem like you want
to say something.</font>

139
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said it before, too, didn't I?</font>

140
00:10:22,140 --> 00:10:26,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A failure is a failure.
You can't change.</font>

141
00:10:30,350 --> 00:10:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise...</font>

142
00:10:42,450 --> 00:10:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll win, no matter what!</font>

143
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:52,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has the look...
of being sure of himself...</font>

144
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's as if he's not all worked up...</font>

145
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That makes it
more worthwhile for me.</font>

146
00:11:00,130 --> 00:11:03,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I look forward to your look
of disappointment...</font>

147
00:11:03,470 --> 00:11:08,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when you know the true reality...</font>

148
00:11:08,770 --> 00:11:10,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop whining.</font>

149
00:11:15,110 --> 00:11:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's... get started!</font>

150
00:11:24,370 --> 00:11:26,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, round one.</font>

151
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:28,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begin!</font>

152
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:33,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch carefully, Hanabi.</font>

153
00:12:33,940 --> 00:12:38,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody has inherited such
a strong Hyuga Kekkei Genkai.</font>

154
00:12:39,230 --> 00:12:41,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To say nothing of your older sister.</font>

155
00:12:42,860 --> 00:12:44,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More than nee-san?</font>

156
00:12:44,490 --> 00:12:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps more than you, too.</font>

157
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time, it's not an opponent
that can be managed easily.</font>

158
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:57,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has that Byakugan.</font>

159
00:13:06,930 --> 00:13:08,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Close combat is no good...</font>

160
00:13:09,930 --> 00:13:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does Naruto know that?</font>

161
00:13:48,180 --> 00:13:51,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! Why would anyone
attack from the front?!</font>

162
00:14:12,410 --> 00:14:13,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! Naruto.</font>

163
00:14:56,370 --> 00:14:58,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The opponent can see
your Chakra Points!</font>

164
00:15:01,290 --> 00:15:02,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're called Chakra Points.</font>

165
00:15:03,170 --> 00:15:05,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If those pressure points
are pressed accurately...</font>

166
00:15:05,300 --> 00:15:08,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the flow of an opponent's Chakra
can be stopped,</font>

167
00:15:08,130 --> 00:15:13,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">amplified or controlled at will.</font>

168
00:15:15,390 --> 00:15:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-oh!</font>

169
00:15:26,230 --> 00:15:27,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I missed, huh...?</font>

170
00:15:30,070 --> 00:15:33,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, he'll press
the pressure point if I get too close</font>

171
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:34,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I'll become unable
to use Jutsu.</font>

172
00:15:34,950 --> 00:15:38,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means all I can do
is fight from a distance.</font>

173
00:15:39,250 --> 00:15:43,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understand, right?
You have no way of winning.</font>

174
00:15:44,670 --> 00:15:49,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... All I did was to verify your power.</font>

175
00:15:59,020 --> 00:16:02,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real fight is just getting started!</font>

176
00:16:07,610 --> 00:16:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

177
00:16:13,450 --> 00:16:15,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You used your head,
didn't you, Naruto?!</font>

178
00:16:15,530 --> 00:16:17,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With the Shadow Clone Jutsu...</font>

179
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:20,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh. He's an interesting kid.</font>

180
00:16:20,950 --> 00:16:23,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu is
a Jonin level technique.</font>

181
00:16:24,500 --> 00:16:27,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he could use
such a Jutsu...</font>

182
00:16:27,630 --> 00:16:30,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows how this'll turn out?</font>

183
00:16:35,470 --> 00:16:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu?!</font>

184
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:42,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it. If Chakra is evenly distributed
among the clones,</font>

185
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:47,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">indeed, I can't detect the
real one even with my Byakugan.</font>

186
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there's only one real one,
after all!</font>

187
00:16:52,990 --> 00:16:55,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh. Don't be acting tough!</font>

188
00:16:56,530 --> 00:16:58,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're going to come,
then come.</font>

189
00:17:02,540 --> 00:17:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's pointless.</font>

190
00:17:04,330 --> 00:17:09,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In front of that Neji's defense,
it's not just all attacking.</font>

191
00:17:12,380 --> 00:17:13,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

192
00:17:14,420 --> 00:17:18,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't... you... underestimate...</font>

193
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:19,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...me!</font>

194
00:17:21,470 --> 00:17:22,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here they come!</font>

195
00:17:38,370 --> 00:17:39,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He hit!</font>

196
00:17:43,450 --> 00:17:44,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool.</font>

197
00:17:49,790 --> 00:17:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

198
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:54,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

199
00:17:54,630 --> 00:17:56,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get you next time!</font>

200
00:18:01,220 --> 00:18:01,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

201
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

202
00:18:40,340 --> 00:18:44,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does he have eyes behind him...?</font>

203
00:18:55,570 --> 00:18:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to become...
the Hokage...?</font>

204
00:18:59,530 --> 00:19:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this level, it's impossible.</font>

205
00:19:04,620 --> 00:19:08,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can generally tell
with these eyes...</font>

206
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:11,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Intrinsic abilities are set.</font>

207
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:17,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Figuratively speaking,
everything inherent about people is set.</font>

208
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:23,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

209
00:19:25,430 --> 00:19:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you always so
judgmental like that?</font>

210
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:34,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... are you going to say
that anybody can become the Hokage...</font>

211
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if they just work hard?</font>

212
00:19:38,610 --> 00:19:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only a very small percentage of
Shinobi are chosen to be the Hokage!</font>

213
00:19:43,530 --> 00:19:45,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look more at reality!</font>

214
00:19:46,490 --> 00:19:50,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who become the Hokage
are born with a destiny.</font>

215
00:19:50,870 --> 00:19:53,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not something you become
by trying to become it.</font>

216
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:56,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's determined by destiny.</font>

217
00:19:57,710 --> 00:20:01,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People must live within
their different respective currents</font>

218
00:20:01,130 --> 00:20:02,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that can't be defied.</font>

219
00:20:06,140 --> 00:20:12,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one single...
destiny everyone has equally...</font>

220
00:20:21,820 --> 00:20:23,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...is death.</font>

221
00:20:30,500 --> 00:20:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those eyes...</font>

222
00:20:31,870 --> 00:20:34,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He still holds a grudge
against the head family, huh?</font>

223
00:20:39,590 --> 00:20:40,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So...</font>

224
